# Plumecreed Escort: "target creature you control gains hexproof until end of turn" (CR 702.11b, 115.1, 514.2). On turn 3 Bot1 casts the
# Escort with Bot2's Memnite on the battlefield: Memnite is not a legal target (refused), so the Escort targets itself, not Bot1's Ornithopter. It has hexproof
# for the turn: Bot2 can't Lightning Bolt it (Mox Ruby untapped). On turn 4 the hexproof is gone and the Bolt kills it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Plumecreed Escort
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

